      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Pinery%2C_Colorado"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The community borders the town of Parker to the north and Castle Rock to the southwest.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
